WEBVTT

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.100 --> 00:22.150
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

01:54.890 --> 01:57.890
<b>You can’t go that way.</b>

02:11.970 --> 02:13.140
<b>Found you!</b>

02:19.440 --> 02:20.610
<b>Huh?</b>

02:35.390 --> 02:37.160
<b>Where do you live?</b>

02:37.160 --> 02:38.100
<b>Here!</b>

02:39.970 --> 02:41.530
<b>Here?</b>

02:43.170 --> 02:44.840
<b>In a place like this?</b>

02:52.810 --> 02:54.250
<b>Weird clothes.</b>

02:54.250 --> 02:56.250
<b>Huh? Weird?</b>

02:59.050 --> 03:01.490
<b>I was told I can’t come in here anymore.</b>

03:01.490 --> 03:04.460
<b>Yes you can!</b>

03:04.460 --> 03:06.190
<b>I’ll get in trouble.</b>

03:10.400 --> 03:12.330
<b>Then we can go somewhere that’s not here?</b>

03:13.870 --> 03:14.970
<b>Yeah...</b>

03:14.970 --> 03:17.170
<b>As long as it’s not here.</b>

03:17.170 --> 03:18.170
<b>Okay.</b>

03:18.170 --> 03:21.110
<b>Then, let’s make a promise, Amu.</b>

03:35.150 --> 03:37.320
<b>And that... was the third one...</b>

03:43.200 --> 03:50.180
<b>Run to Tana,
Which is on the Verge of Tears</b>

03:59.680 --> 04:01.820
<b>Tana Neighborhood Council</b>

04:08.890 --> 04:11.890
<b>So... you’re going to the festival after all.</b>

04:11.890 --> 04:13.430
<b>I could say the same to you.</b>

04:13.430 --> 04:16.190
<b>Didn’t you say something about not being interested?</b>

04:16.190 --> 04:20.200
<b>I’m not interested
in the “Cat Dance” itself...</b>

04:20.200 --> 04:21.330
<b>Then, what?</b>

04:26.510 --> 04:28.610
<b>It’s because...</b>

04:28.610 --> 04:31.280
<b>...I saw a weird thing again.</b>

04:31.280 --> 04:32.880
<b>What kind of thing?</b>

04:32.880 --> 04:34.650
<b>Umm...</b>

04:34.650 --> 04:35.850
<b>No, never mind.</b>

04:35.850 --> 04:38.150
<b>You’ll just make fun of me,
so I won’t say it.</b>

04:39.150 --> 04:40.190
<b>See, you’re laughing already.</b>

04:40.190 --> 04:40.690
<b>No...</b>

04:40.690 --> 04:43.270
<b>Kaburaki!</b>

04:43.270 --> 04:45.890
<b>Need an umbrella?</b>

04:45.890 --> 04:46.930
<b>Thanks.</b>

04:46.930 --> 04:49.190
<b>It’s all right, though.</b>

04:49.190 --> 04:52.400
<b>The rain seems like it’ll let up soon.</b>

05:06.650 --> 05:09.310
<b>So that was the first promise, huh?</b>

05:09.310 --> 05:10.310
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:11.480 --> 05:13.890
<b>Then we can go somewhere that’s not here?</b>

05:13.890 --> 05:14.650
<b>Yeah...</b>

05:14.650 --> 05:16.520
<b>As long as it’s not here.</b>

05:16.520 --> 05:17.290
<b>Okay.</b>

05:17.290 --> 05:19.320
<b>Then, let’s make a promise, Amu.</b>

05:19.320 --> 05:21.460
<b>Up at the top of the mountain.</b>

05:21.460 --> 05:23.260
<b>All the way at the top!</b>

05:23.260 --> 05:25.300
<b>There’s a bridge that goes over a river.</b>

05:25.300 --> 05:27.270
<b>I’ll wait for you there!</b>

05:27.270 --> 05:28.800
<b>Let’s play there!</b>

05:31.340 --> 05:34.070
<b>So you were waiting the whole time...</b>

05:34.070 --> 05:34.940
<b>Yeah...</b>

05:34.940 --> 05:38.980
<b>And because I said
your clothes were weird...</b>

05:38.980 --> 05:43.010
<b>...you put on the same poncho
as me, and started waiting.</b>

05:43.010 --> 05:44.450
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:44.450 --> 05:46.620
<b>You were waiting the whole time...</b>

05:46.620 --> 05:49.020
<b>...without forgetting about the promise.</b>

05:49.020 --> 05:50.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:53.430 --> 05:54.490
<b>I’m sorry...</b>

05:57.060 --> 05:58.530
<b>I’m really sorry.</b>

05:58.530 --> 05:59.700
<b>Forget it.</b>

05:59.700 --> 06:00.930
<b>I don’t know you anymore.</b>

06:05.270 --> 06:08.670
<b>Mom, I’m going to play!</b>

06:09.540 --> 06:11.310
<b>I’m not going home!</b>

06:11.310 --> 06:13.540
<b>Wakkun’s waiting for me!</b>

06:16.550 --> 06:19.350
<b>Stop! I’m going!</b>

06:19.350 --> 06:21.350
<b>He’s waiting for me!</b>

06:25.920 --> 06:28.090
<b>I completely forgot...</b>

06:28.090 --> 06:30.590
<b>The day after I made that promise with you...</b>

06:30.600 --> 06:33.160
<b>...I suddenly had to go home.</b>

06:33.170 --> 06:34.470
<b>Amu...</b>

06:34.470 --> 06:35.870
<b>You’re going home again...</b>

06:35.870 --> 06:37.470
<b>You’ll be gone again...</b>

06:37.470 --> 06:37.970
<b>Right?</b>

06:43.080 --> 06:46.080
<b>I don’t like... waiting.</b>

06:48.110 --> 06:49.010
<b>All right!</b>

06:49.010 --> 06:51.450
<b>Due to the rain, the performance
was slightly delayed...</b>

06:51.450 --> 06:53.820
<b>...but let’s finally get things started this year!</b>

06:53.820 --> 06:55.820
<b>To start things off, let’s see entry #1...</b>

06:55.820 --> 06:58.790
<b>...the “Paw Angels”!</b>

07:02.790 --> 07:05.060
<b>Miku... is something wrong?</b>

07:05.060 --> 07:06.100
<b>Umm...</b>

07:06.100 --> 07:08.300
<b>It seems like she’s worrying
about something.</b>

07:08.300 --> 07:09.970
<b>Is she going to be all right?</b>

07:09.970 --> 07:12.340
<b>I’m perfectly fine.</b>

07:12.340 --> 07:14.710
<b>In that case, shall we run through
the skit one more time?</b>

07:16.480 --> 07:17.980
<b>Miku, can you do it?</b>

07:17.980 --> 07:20.150
<b>Aizawa Ayumu...</b>

07:20.150 --> 07:22.680
<b>...might come and see it, so...</b>

07:22.680 --> 07:24.050
<b>...I guess I’ll do it.</b>

07:24.050 --> 07:25.920
<b>Who’s that?</b>

07:25.920 --> 07:30.090
<b>Oh, it’s just that Miki-nee’s
finally at that age.</b>

07:30.090 --> 07:32.360
<b>He’s not...! What are you saying?!</b>

07:38.860 --> 07:40.770
<b>Amu...</b>

07:40.770 --> 07:42.370
<b>Let’s go together.</b>

07:43.340 --> 07:46.540
<b>If we go, we can play forever.</b>

07:46.540 --> 07:47.910
<b>But...</b>

07:47.910 --> 07:49.440
<b>...I won’t be able to return.</b>

07:50.480 --> 07:53.680
<b>Don’t you... want to play?</b>

07:53.680 --> 07:57.650
<b>How about I only go beyond there for
the time that you waited for me?</b>

08:00.290 --> 08:01.550
<b>Will you come?</b>

08:17.440 --> 08:18.440
<b>There’s a festival tonight.</b>

08:20.140 --> 08:22.310
<b>Want to go to the festival with me?</b>

08:23.410 --> 08:26.810
<b>This will be my first time going.</b>

08:26.810 --> 08:28.380
<b>Let’s go.</b>

08:28.950 --> 08:32.350
<b>Geez... why do I have to do this?</b>

08:42.890 --> 08:45.160
<b>Huh? What’s the matter?</b>

08:45.160 --> 08:47.330
<b>Don’t ask me!</b>

08:47.870 --> 08:50.840
<b>Miku told me to come here and check things out.</b>

08:50.840 --> 08:53.340
<b>Just what have you been doing here?</b>

08:53.340 --> 08:55.170
<b>Well, just some things...</b>

08:56.110 --> 08:58.810
<b>It’s okay. He won’t hurt you.</b>

08:59.810 --> 09:01.410
<b>Who are you talking to?</b>

09:01.410 --> 09:01.980
<b>Wakkun.</b>

09:03.720 --> 09:05.680
<b>If you don’t understand, that’s fine.</b>

09:07.150 --> 09:09.320
<b>What’s up with that?</b>

09:15.160 --> 09:16.360
<b>The kappa?!</b>

09:26.370 --> 09:27.840
<b>Stop it.</b>

09:43.320 --> 09:45.320
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

09:46.490 --> 09:47.470
<b>Try to focus!</b>

09:50.230 --> 09:52.130
<b>I know, I know.</b>

10:02.070 --> 10:05.680
<b>That was entry #6...</b>

10:05.680 --> 10:07.650
<b>...“Kitty Max”!</b>

10:09.010 --> 10:11.620
<b>Moving on, we have entry #7...</b>

10:12.120 --> 10:14.690
<b>...the “Lovey-Dovey Welcoming Cat Squad”!</b>

10:14.690 --> 10:15.850
<b>Come on up!</b>

10:20.930 --> 10:25.400
<b>So we can’t see them directly,
but they reflect in the eyes of dogs.</b>

10:25.400 --> 10:26.560
<b>Yeah...</b>

10:26.570 --> 10:28.170
<b>I’m not lying.</b>

10:28.170 --> 10:31.940
<b>That announcer Sukawara also said
there was something in this valley.</b>

10:32.940 --> 10:37.210
<b>Well... I can’t say anything about
something I can’t even see.</b>

10:40.250 --> 10:41.980
<b>I think...</b>

10:41.980 --> 10:44.420
<b>...Ayumu can see them, too.</b>

11:04.070 --> 11:05.240
<b>Hey, wait up.</b>

11:05.240 --> 11:08.210
<b>I’m helping out with goldfish scooping.</b>

11:08.740 --> 11:11.240
<b>Come on and do it. My treat.</b>

11:11.240 --> 11:13.080
<b>No... it’s all right.</b>

11:13.080 --> 11:14.310
<b>Do it!</b>

11:14.310 --> 11:16.180
<b>Amu, do it!</b>

11:16.180 --> 11:17.180
<b>Okay...</b>

11:17.180 --> 11:18.050
<b>Then...</b>

11:18.050 --> 11:19.060
<b>All right.</b>

11:19.620 --> 11:20.590
<b>Shouko-san.</b>

11:20.590 --> 11:21.730
<b>Huh?</b>

11:21.730 --> 11:23.990
<b>This guy’s my customer.</b>

11:26.000 --> 11:27.610
<b>Oh, my!</b>

11:27.610 --> 11:30.270
<b>Is this your special purple-rimmed #5 person?</b>

11:30.280 --> 11:32.280
<b>No! It’s not like that!</b>

11:32.280 --> 11:34.410
<b>He’s just a friend. Just a friend.</b>

11:36.380 --> 11:38.310
<b>This one! I want this one!</b>

11:40.790 --> 11:41.790
<b>Okay.</b>

12:06.880 --> 12:08.180
<b>Stop!</b>

12:09.710 --> 12:12.980
<b>Dear, don’t you think it’s a bad idea to do this now?</b>

12:12.980 --> 12:15.490
<b>This is way too soon.</b>

12:15.490 --> 12:18.660
<b>Today’s the festival, so it should be fine.</b>

12:18.660 --> 12:20.660
<b>Let’s finish this quickly and go home.</b>

12:28.870 --> 12:29.870
<b>Dear!</b>

12:34.570 --> 12:36.470
<b>Don’t yell like that.</b>

12:38.710 --> 12:40.040
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

13:21.190 --> 13:22.620
<b>What the...?</b>

13:36.100 --> 13:38.140
<b>You’ve gotta be kidding me.</b>

13:38.140 --> 13:39.170
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:39.170 --> 13:41.110
<b>No, blockade the roads between the fields for now...</b>

13:41.110 --> 13:44.440
<b>...and once the fire department comes,
we can let them handle the rest.</b>

13:44.440 --> 13:46.110
<b>Okay.</b>

13:46.110 --> 13:48.580
<b>I’ll call you from here.</b>

13:48.580 --> 13:49.750
<b>Was there an accident?</b>

13:51.050 --> 13:51.880
<b>Even worse.</b>

13:54.190 --> 13:55.850
<b>This is a disaster.</b>

14:02.290 --> 14:03.360
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

14:04.730 --> 14:05.800
<b>Sorry. Here!</b>

14:08.600 --> 14:10.270
<b>Hey! Wait a sec!</b>

14:18.510 --> 14:19.610
<b>No problems.</b>

14:20.150 --> 14:22.150
<b>If the real performance goes just like that...</b>

14:24.220 --> 14:26.080
<b>Dad!</b>

14:26.080 --> 14:30.150
<b>We’re fine over here, so go do your own work.</b>

14:30.160 --> 14:31.520
<b>I am.</b>

14:32.560 --> 14:34.760
<b>The dam broke.</b>

14:34.760 --> 14:37.400
<b>I’m heading over there now to take a look at things.</b>

14:37.400 --> 14:40.400
<b>I’m sorry I won’t be able to see your
dance, but do your best anyway.</b>

14:43.740 --> 14:44.230
<b>Dad...</b>

14:46.300 --> 14:48.310
<b>Be careful...</b>

14:48.310 --> 14:50.310
<b>Yeah. I’ll be back in no time.</b>

14:52.780 --> 14:56.180
<b>Hey... help me down.</b>

15:10.760 --> 15:13.860
<b>You’re really cold.</b>

15:12.130 --> 15:13.860
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

15:13.870 --> 15:17.770
<b>But... I don’t hate that about you.</b>

15:19.370 --> 15:20.240
<b>Unno.</b>

15:21.410 --> 15:22.410
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

15:24.280 --> 15:25.310
<b>What?</b>

15:25.940 --> 15:27.850
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

15:27.850 --> 15:30.650
<b>No... I don’t want to hear that.</b>

15:30.650 --> 15:33.280
<b>I’m sorry for being half-hearted with you all this time.</b>

15:35.690 --> 15:38.620
<b>Don’t say it.</b>

15:36.290 --> 15:38.620
<b>I... can’t go out with you.</b>

15:38.620 --> 15:39.560
<b>I like Miyama–</b>

15:39.560 --> 15:42.690
<b>Miyama... has Aizawa-kun.</b>

15:43.700 --> 15:45.530
<b>That’s not definite yet.</b>

15:49.970 --> 15:51.570
<b>Anyway... I’m sorry.</b>

16:01.280 --> 16:05.480
<b><i>Really... every last person here is the worst!</i></b>

16:08.290 --> 16:10.120
<b>I’ll take care of filming here.</b>

16:10.120 --> 16:11.260
<b>You can go.</b>

16:11.260 --> 16:14.460
<b>Thanks! If something happens,
I’ll contact you right away.</b>

16:23.370 --> 16:24.540
<b>Wait!</b>

16:24.540 --> 16:26.300
<b>Wakkun!</b>

16:30.070 --> 16:31.230
<b>The mountain...</b>

16:33.670 --> 16:34.700
<b>The mountain?</b>

16:34.700 --> 16:37.040
<b>The mountain is crying.</b>

16:37.910 --> 16:39.470
<b>It’s about to cry!</b>

16:44.150 --> 16:45.780
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

16:45.780 --> 16:47.780
<b>That was entry #13...</b>

16:47.780 --> 16:49.780
<b>...the “Dried Sardines”!</b>

17:04.700 --> 17:05.970
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

17:45.070 --> 17:47.940
<b>Roku, do you want to go with them?</b>

17:49.640 --> 17:51.080
<b>Go on.</b>

17:59.720 --> 18:01.760
<b>We’re almost up.</b>

18:02.760 --> 18:04.590
<b>Get ready. Get ready!</b>

18:04.590 --> 18:07.900
<b>It’s fine if you collapse after we dance.</b>

18:07.900 --> 18:09.460
<b>Aizawa Ayumu...</b>

18:12.270 --> 18:14.070
<b>So, Wakkun’s with you.</b>

18:15.940 --> 18:19.240
<b>U-Umm... this is my older sister, Mika.</b>

18:19.240 --> 18:21.640
<b>Oh? He’s pretty cute.</b>

18:22.480 --> 18:23.680
<b>So... who’s this Wakkun?</b>

18:23.680 --> 18:26.180
<b>I’m not too sure myself.</b>

18:26.180 --> 18:28.320
<b>She couldn’t be talking about...
Miku’s imaginary friend?</b>

18:28.320 --> 18:30.550
<b>He exists. Wakkun does exist.</b>

18:30.550 --> 18:32.250
<b>Oh...? Is that so...</b>

18:32.250 --> 18:33.690
<b>So he... exists...</b>

18:35.190 --> 18:38.260
<b>He’s saying that the mountain is crying...</b>

18:38.260 --> 18:40.560
<b>...but I’m not sure what he means.</b>

18:40.560 --> 18:42.030
<b>The mountain?</b>

18:42.600 --> 18:44.330
<b>This isn’t good...</b>

18:44.330 --> 18:45.670
<b>We can’t stay here!</b>

18:45.670 --> 18:49.600
<b>Dad did say the erosion control dam broke...</b>

18:49.600 --> 18:52.640
<b>Then... is that what “the mountain
is about to cry” meant?</b>

18:53.280 --> 18:56.640
<b>Things keep getting more and more exciting!</b>

18:56.650 --> 18:59.580
<b>Judge Nekogamashi, what do you
think of the teams this year?</b>

19:00.080 --> 19:01.150
<b>Amu.</b>

19:01.850 --> 19:04.020
<b>We can’t stay here!</b>

19:04.020 --> 19:05.120
<b>Let’s go!</b>

19:09.660 --> 19:11.830
<b>Umm, Wakkun...</b>

19:11.830 --> 19:14.700
<b>I wonder if you can talk to Dosshiru
and Shisshin for me.</b>

19:14.700 --> 19:15.900
<b>Tell them what?</b>

19:16.330 --> 19:17.430
<b>Come over here.</b>

19:19.500 --> 19:21.740
<b>Is your boyfriend sane...?</b>

19:21.740 --> 19:24.910
<b>I’m telling you, it’s not like that!</b>

19:24.910 --> 19:27.170
<b>This isn’t a good place to be, right?</b>

19:27.180 --> 19:28.810
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:28.810 --> 19:33.480
<b>Could you talk to Dosshiru and Shisshin
and have them tell everyone here?</b>

19:36.490 --> 19:37.890
<b>If you...</b>

19:40.920 --> 19:43.360
<b>If you come with me...</b>

19:54.240 --> 19:56.900
<b>Aizawa-kun, are you all right?</b>

19:56.910 --> 19:57.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:00.180 --> 20:01.810
<b>Let’s go.</b>

20:01.810 --> 20:04.680
<b>That might... also be a good idea.</b>

20:06.580 --> 20:08.150
<b>Okay!</b>

20:18.560 --> 20:20.090
<b>What the, UFOs?!</b>

20:20.100 --> 20:21.530
<b>Hey! What are those things?!</b>

20:22.660 --> 20:23.960
<b>What the...?</b>

20:29.840 --> 20:30.640
<b>Here they come.</b>

20:30.640 --> 20:32.610
<b>Aren’t those UFOs?</b>

20:32.610 --> 20:34.210
<b>Here they come!</b>

20:36.710 --> 20:38.210
<b>What is this?</b>

20:38.210 --> 20:39.910
<b>Huh?</b>

20:39.920 --> 20:43.020
<b>Doumaru, forget the stage.
Film the lights.</b>

20:43.020 --> 20:45.690
<b>I know. I’m the director here.</b>

20:47.120 --> 20:48.690
<b>Amu... promise.</b>

20:48.690 --> 20:49.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:55.600 --> 20:57.100
<b>The cats!</b>

21:20.390 --> 21:22.860
<b>Yosuke, wait!</b>

21:23.490 --> 21:24.430
<b>We’re going after them!</b>

21:24.430 --> 21:26.160
<b>Of course!</b>

21:33.070 --> 21:35.040
<b>Old Lady Okaka?!</b>

21:45.550 --> 21:46.650
<b>What was that?</b>

21:46.650 --> 21:48.250
<b>I’m going!</b>

21:48.250 --> 21:49.920
<b>This looks like the real thing.</b>

21:54.190 --> 21:56.020
<b>Hey, Takuma!</b>

21:57.330 --> 21:58.860
<b>Did you see Old Lady Okaka?</b>

21:58.860 --> 21:59.930
<b>No...</b>

21:59.930 --> 22:01.930
<b>But that aside, what’s all this fuss?</b>

22:01.930 --> 22:02.970
<b>I dunno!</b>

22:02.970 --> 22:04.840
<b>Anyway, Old Lady Okaka was here!</b>

22:06.410 --> 22:07.670
<b>Umm...</b>

22:09.410 --> 22:11.640
<b>Now that it’s turned out like this...</b>

22:13.480 --> 22:15.150
<b>...what should we do?</b>

22:15.150 --> 22:16.750
<b>Even if you ask me that...</b>

22:18.320 --> 22:21.250
<b>Hey... don’t you feel like something’s not right?</b>

22:24.260 --> 22:25.730
<b>What is this...?</b>

22:43.740 --> 22:45.410
<b>Shall we...</b>

22:45.410 --> 22:46.840
<b>...go, too?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.970 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:19.970 --> 24:23.440
<b>Really... after moving that much,
it really has an effect on your body.</b>

24:23.440 --> 24:25.910
<b>Grandma, what’s wrong? You look tired.</b>

24:25.910 --> 24:28.080
<b>It’s because I ran around a lot
for the first time in a while.</b>

24:28.080 --> 24:29.920
<b>Since you’re old, you shouldn’t push yourself too hard.</b>

24:29.920 --> 24:31.410
<b>I’m perfectly healthy!</b>

24:31.410 --> 24:34.080
<b>What about you, Roku?
You also ran quite a bit.</b>

24:34.080 --> 24:36.120
<b>I-I’m pretty much okay.</b>

24:36.120 --> 24:38.560
<b>It’s not like I’ve got muscular rheumatism
and can’t move or anything...</b>

24:38.560 --> 24:41.820
<b>Hey, hey! Something even more incredible
is going to happen next time, right?</b>

24:41.820 --> 24:45.060
<b>That’s right! Something even more amazing
will happen at the Cat Dance!</b>

24:45.060 --> 24:47.530
<b>Next time will be: “Dancing About
the Sky of the Cat Dance.”</b>

24:47.530 --> 24:49.330
<b>I wanna go!</b>

24:49.330 --> 24:50.560
<b>Then, shall we go?</b>

24:50.570 --> 24:50.970
<b>Yeah!</b>

24:50.970 --> 24:54.400
<b>They say muscular rheumatism takes
two days to work on older people.</b>

24:54.400 --> 24:57.640
<b>So I think it will affect Old Lady Okaka tomorrow.</b>

24:55.000 --> 24:59.950
<b>Dancing About the Sky of the Cat Dance</b>
